# Keeps secrets, local state and other apps out of the API image.
.git
.github
docs
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/uploads
**/*.log
**/bot.err
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Environment files carry real keys. The image gets its settings from Render.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# The API image needs only the web app's manifest, for the shared lockfile.
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
